The weights were pretrained on a purpose-built mix whose real-text sources
are attributed here as their licences ask (docs/RELEASE.md carries the
verification dates and docs/MODEL-CARD.md the same block for readers of the
model card):

  * FineWeb-Edu (HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu), Open Data Commons Attribution
    License (ODC-By) v1.0. Use of Common Crawl-derived data is additionally
    subject to Common Crawl's terms of use.
  * SODA (allenai/soda), Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    (CC BY 4.0).
  * Natural Questions (google-research-datasets/natural_questions), Creative
    Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0). The weights
    are licensed under the common position that model weights are not an
    adaptation of training text; attribution is given regardless.

Every generated slice of the corpus was produced by this repository's own
generators. Nothing in the shipped artefact carries a person's data: the
contact book, notes, packs, schedule and transcripts are per-instance files
that never leave the machine they are written on.

